-- Purpose: Handles Camera, Dialogue Logic, and UI for Legendary Monk3yDAngelo-Cars NPC, including Inquiry and Crafting.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts
-- Dependencies: TweenService, Players, Workspace, SoundService, UserInputService, ReplicatedStorage
-- Public API: UpdateLegendaryAngeloDialogue (BindableEvent)
-- Networking: Fires ShopRemotes.OpenLegendaryShop (Client -> Server)
-- Security: Validates local character state before locking movement. Uses debounces to prevent spam.
-- Performance: Safely manages nested task threads and event cleanup. Recursive search handles nested buttons efficiently.
-- Notes: Includes the Inquiry button to explain the legendary sacrifice mechanics.

